        "## The ROC Curve\n",
        "\n",
        ":::{.fragment}\n",
        "\n",
        "The **Receiver Operating Characteristic (ROC) curve** plots the **true positive rate** (sensitivity) against the **false positive rate** (1 - specificity) as the threshold $\\tau$ varies from 1 to 0.\n",
